### ========================================================
### HOSTELPULSE FOUNDATION API - REST CLIENT SUITE
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api/v1
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### 2. Get Hostel Blocks (Gender filtered or all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/blocks?gender=male

### 3. Warden Login (Male Block Warden Vikram)
# @name wardenLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "W-MALE-101",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Store Token Variable from Login Response
@wardenToken = {{wardenLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Warden Views Pending Students (Scoped strictly to Boys Block A)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/pending-students
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}

### 5. Warden Approves Student Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/students/5/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Approved Student Login (Laminated ID)
# @name studentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "HID-BBA-001",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 7. Student Profile & Assigned Warden Verification
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 8. View Weekly Dining Menus & Cut-Off Config
GET {{baseUrl}}/food/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 9. Student Submits Next Day's Meal Preference
POST {{baseUrl}}/food/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mealDate": "2026-10-16",
  "mealType": "lunch",
  "selectedOptionId": "opt_nonveg_lunch"
}

### 10. Student Views Their Recorded Preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/food/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 11. Mess Staff Login
# @name messLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "mess@hostelpulse.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

@messToken = {{messLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 12. Mess Staff Generates Daily Meal Count Report (Excludes approved outpasses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/food/report?date=2026-10-16
Authorization: Bearer {{messToken}}

### 13. Student Checks In-App Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 14. Student Marks Notification as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 15. Forgot Password - Request 6-digit OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rahul.sharma@hostelpulse.edu"
}

### 16. Admin Chief Warden Login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin@hostelpulse.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 17. Admin Dashboard Overview Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. Admin Creates New Block
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ramanujan Boys Block C",
  "code": "RBC",
  "gender": "male",
  "totalFloors": 4,
  "description": "New postgraduate boys wing"
}

### 19. Admin Pre-loads Warden to Roster (Instant auto-approval upon sign-up)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/wardens/preload
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collegeIdNumber": "W-MALE-301",
  "fullName": "Dr. Rajesh Khanna",
  "email": "rajesh.khanna@hostelpulse.edu",
  "gender": "male",
  "blockId": 1
}

### 20. Admin Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 21. Query Maintenance Auto-Assignees by Category (Contract for Complaints Teammate)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/maintenance/assignees?category=Plumbing+%26+Water+Supply
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
